<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR" data-theme="dark">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>RecyTech — <%= mode === 'login' ? 'Entrar' : 'Criar conta' %></title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --green:#1f8a4c; --green-dark:#15672f; --green-light:#e6f5eb;
    --bg:#f7faf8; --card:#ffffff; --text:#16241c; --muted:#5a6b62; --border:#e1e9e3;
    --accent:#ffb400;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);
    padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]){
      --bg:#0f1712; --card:#17211b; --text:#eaf3ee; --muted:#9db2a7; --border:#25322b; --green-light:#152a1e;
    }
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"]{
    --bg:#0f1712; --card:#17211b; --text:#eaf3ee; --muted:#9db2a7; --border:#25322b; --green-light:#152a1e;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);}
  body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;}
  h1,h2,h3{font-family:Poppins,system-ui,sans-serif;margin:0 0 8px;}
  .wrap{max-width:920px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px;}
  .bg-photo{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(3,18,8,.28) 0%,rgba(3,18,8,.5) 50%,rgba(3,18,8,.82) 100%),url(data:image/jpeg;base64,) 62% 50%/cover no-repeat,#0a3a1b;}
  header.top{position:sticky;top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);background:rgba(15,23,18,.55);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(8px);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);z-index:10;}
  header.top .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px 20px;}
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:700;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--text);text-decoration:none;}
  .hero{padding:36px 0 20px;text-align:center;}
  .hero h1,.hero p{text-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.6);}
  .hero p{color:#e3ece6;max-width:520px;margin:8px auto 0;}
  .tag{display:inline-block;background:rgba(21,42,30,.85);color:#8fe3ae;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.02em;}
  .card{background:rgba(23,33,27,.86);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:14px;padding:24px;margin:8px auto 14px;max-width:420px;}
  label{display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:.85rem;margin:12px 0 6px;}
  input[type=text],input[type=email],input[type=password]{width:100%;padding:11px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-size:.95rem;font-family:inherit;}
  input:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,a.ghost-link:focus-visible,.brand:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--green);outline-offset:2px;}
  button.primary{background:var(--green);color:#fff;border:none;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;cursor:pointer;width:100%;margin-top:16px;font-family:inherit;}
  a.ghost-link{display:block;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:600;font-size:.85rem;margin-top:10px;}
  .hint{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0;}
  .switch{margin:20px 0 0;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;}
  .error{font-size:.84rem;color:#f28b82;background:rgba(220,60,60,.12);border:1px solid rgba(220,60,60,.35);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;margin:14px 0 0;}
  footer{text-align:center;color:#c9d6cd;font-size:.78rem;padding:20px 0 40px;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="bg-photo" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<header class="top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="brand" href="/">♻️RecyTech</a>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="wrap">
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Descarte certo. Cidade limpa. Você recompensado.</h1>
    <p>Encontre pontos de descarte perto de você, registre o que descartou e ganhe recompensas reais por manter Betim mais limpa.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3><%= mode === 'login' ? 'Entrar na sua conta' : 'Criar sua conta' %></h3>
    <form method="POST" action="<%= mode === 'login' ? '/login' : '/cadastro' %>">
      <input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
      <% if (mode === 'cadastro') { %>
        <label for="name">Nome</label>
        <input type="text" id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" minlength="2" maxlength="80" required value="<%= values.name || '' %>">
      <% } %>
      <label for="email">E-mail</label>
      <input type="email" id="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required value="<%= values.email || '' %>">
      <label for="password">Senha</label>
      <input type="password" id="password" name="password" autocomplete="<%= mode === 'login' ? 'current-password' : 'new-password' %>" minlength="6" maxlength="128" required>
      <% if (mode === 'cadastro') { %>
        <p class="hint">Use de 6 a 128 caracteres.</p>
      <% } %>
      <% if (error) { %>
        <p class="error" role="alert"><%= error %></p>
      <% } %>
      <button class="primary" type="submit"><%= mode === 'login' ? 'Entrar' : 'Criar conta' %></button>
    </form>
    <% if (mode === 'login') { %>
      <p class="switch">Ainda não tem conta?</p>
      <a class="ghost-link" href="/cadastro">Criar conta</a>
    <% } else { %>
      <p class="switch">Já tem conta?</p>
      <a class="ghost-link" href="/login">Entrar</a>
    <% } %>
  </div>
</main>

</body>
</html>
